            // Prompt explicitly says: "Six pockets (four corners + the middle of each long rail)."
            // Wait, standard pool tables have pockets at mid-OF LONG RAILS. That makes 2 side pocket holes in total + 4 corners = 6. 
            // My coordinates above were for short rails? No, H is height. Long rail is along W axis (Y=R or Y=H-R).
            // Correct locations: Corners + Mid of each long edge (Top/Bottom center).
        ];
        this.pockets = [
             {x: 0, y: 0}, 
             {x: this.W, y: 0},
             {x: 0, y: this.H},
             {x: this.W, y: this.H},
